Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:31:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Stop the daily drop hanging in lyriccheck, and hear the
 whole catalogue.

Whisper on the full mix with no timeout held 2026-11-02-5 for 102 minutes after
the render finished, then killed the job. The same hang is running now on
2026-11-03-3. Listen with VAD, a deadline, and a 180s cap so a stuck
recogniser is a warning, not a missed day.

Uniqueness only compared the newest 40 masters, so once the catalogue grew
past that the original Suno records dropped out of the check. Compare all of
them, and if a cap is set keep the newest and oldest halves.
